  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This morning I clicked into the VRChat website, and was pleasantly surprised to see a \"Your events\" tab right at the top of the page which reminded me about the events that I had added that were coming up. This was a really good idea, and let me see at a glance what I have coming up.\n\nAt some point during the day this tab changed to include *all* events from groups I am in and featured events.  This makes the section totally useless to me.\n\nPlease revert this!",
